Package: freedomnas-module-containers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, freedomnas-core, freedomnas-webui
Description: Containers for FreedomNAS: Docker on its own ZFS datasets
 FreedomNAS community module that sets up the container runtime with its
 data on a ZFS dataset of a chosen pool, outside the root dataset, so it
 survives a rollback and can be snapshotted and replicated.
 .
 Ships modules/containers/ and profiles/containers/ under
 /usr/lib/freedomnas/.
